{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the city\u2019s last line of defense against the blackout. The old power manager quit during a storm, and now it\u2019s your job to keep the lights on with nothing but frayed wires, half-working buildings, and a budget that wouldn\u2019t power a toaster. Every day brings new demands, every night requires more power, and every season finds a new way to make your life harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t expect gratitude. Citizens complain about everything: the heat, the cold, outages \u2014 even pigeons on strike. You\u2019ll juggle happiness, finances, and a grid that loves to set itself on fire, all while storms roll in and the economy collapses. The only help you\u2019ll get is from questionable upgrades, like lightning rods, backup generators, or maybe just some help with the rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Grid Panic is a <strong>survival comedy</strong> where the question isn\u2019t \u201ccan you build the perfect city?\u201d but \u201chow long can you delay inevitable disaster?\u201d Each run plays differently, with random weather, and your own bad decisions combining into a blackout story worth telling. Three days, thirty days \u2014 or five minutes before the pigeons shut you down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837330?t=1761451469","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837330?t=1761451469","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837330/15b3952f8d5e4f90cd9c4f672561227cf634d6df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761451469","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837330/15b3952f8d5e4f90cd9c4f672561227cf634d6df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761451469","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the city\u2019s last line of defense against the blackout. The old power manager quit during a storm, and now it\u2019s your job to keep the lights on with nothing but frayed wires, half-working buildings, and a budget that wouldn\u2019t power a toaster. Every day brings new demands, every night requires more power, and every season finds a new way to make your life harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t expect gratitude. Citizens complain about everything: the heat, the cold, outages \u2014 even pigeons on strike. You\u2019ll juggle happiness, finances, and a grid that loves to set itself on fire, all while storms roll in and the economy collapses. The only help you\u2019ll get is from questionable upgrades, like lightning rods, backup generators, or maybe just some help with the rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Grid Panic is a <strong>survival comedy</strong> where the question isn\u2019t \u201ccan you build the perfect city?\u201d but \u201chow long can you delay inevitable disaster?\u201d Each run plays differently, with random weather, and your own bad decisions combining into a blackout story worth telling. Three days, thirty days \u2014 or five minutes before the pigeons shut you down.</p>","developers":["Altair Alpha Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837330/3fb035a34f17277eccf53321af322b288ca4c614/header.jpg?t=1761451469","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837330